From 66b10f61eb47fbf94e4d6de9b596263125a0ca92 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yang Tsao <yang@fydeos.io>
Date: Wed, 8 Jul 2026 18:10:54 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 4/5] fydroid-rt: add "Open with game control panel" per-app
 toggle

Add a SwitchPreference on the App info page that records the package in
the Settings.Secure "fydroid_game_packages" list. The ARC bridge
(ArcAppService.getAppCategory) reports those packages to ChromeOS as
CATEGORY_GAME, letting sideloaded games -- which have
ApplicationInfo.category == UNDEFINED because no Play Store ever called
setApplicationCategoryHint() -- opt into the ChromeOS Game Dashboard, the
Game Controls mouse/keyboard-to-touch overlay, and full-screen game
efficiency (IsGame).

Localized into the top 10 UI languages (en, zh-CN, zh-TW, ja, ko, es, fr,
de, pt/pt-BR, ru).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Change-Id: I787b2247f1728049485ddda8b42aa503e6c1ad09
